## history
### 2026-09-05 (UTC) — first baseline: the union-arm traversal corpus (schema#565)
- baseline created over 9 tables — data written BEFORE this point is not covered by it

### 2026-09-05 (UTC) — the list-of-unions shape Chain joins the union-arm corpus (schema#565)
- no compatibility-affecting edits; the wire absorbs the rest

### 2026-09-05 (UTC) — the array-of-pointers arm shapes Rack and Tray join the union-arm corpus (schema#578)
- no compatibility-affecting edits; the wire absorbs the rest

### 2026-10-21 (UTC) — schema#reserved-words: fields renamed off every supported language's reserved words (SPEC §4.6, Glenn 2026-10-21) under was =, so the wire ids hold; the JSON keys follow the new names
- Chain.past: renamed under was = "after", which keeps the wire id and NOT the text key — the JSON key is now "past"; pair json = "after" if an existing text must still read (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §16.4) [warn]
- Gate.past: renamed under was = "after", which keeps the wire id and NOT the text key — the JSON key is now "past"; pair json = "after" if an existing text must still read (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §16.4) [warn]
